y attestation, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again if the issuer refuses the nonce — and a refresh can’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"run without the holder. The Secure Enclave","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enforces it. Off, the app asks for it itself (with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"LAContext.evaluatePolicy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") before every presentation — in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the app, from a link, through a document provider extension,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and in person — a check the app’s own code keeps, not the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key. For Face ID, the app’s Info.plist must have an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; without one, iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead. A presentation answering several documents","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at once (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/respond(answers:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(answers:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":") asks once: its holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keys share one authentication context for that call only.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:12OID4VCWallet16KeychainKeyStoreC7OptionsV18holderUserPresenceSbvp","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"holderUserPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":"